{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"<#638590420254720030>","created_at":"2020-07-30T02:55:59.974000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738228373968650250","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"So? What are your questions?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:03:10.615000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738230180207657052","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"You have feminine features, but I never hear you identify in such a way. Could you explain?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:03:56.754000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738230373728649256","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"(brb)","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:04:13.578000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738230444293881927","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Well... I do, in fact, have a feminine body, as you could probably tell by my chest – however meagre it may be. I... Where I was born, only men are allowed to rule. I didn't see myself as a woman, but I also didn't feel exactly like a man. Maybe it's because all the men in my life up to that point were assholes, or maybe it's because all the women back home seemed to be in a club I was excluded from. I held too much brainpower to be a \"woman\" but not enough real power to be a \"man\". Regardless, it was deeper than nurture. See, I *feel* like a woman just as often as I feel like a man, and most of the time I don't *feel* either. I may present in different ways – and, admittedly, this more-androgynous form is to my liking – but at the core of it, I don't align myself with either of the binary genders. I am somewhere in between, but also somewhere completely different... if that makes any sense...\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:12:34.602000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738232545740849203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"You are free and welcome to be a woman, a man, or anywhere in between. Love is what matters the most to me. However this brings me to my second question. What should I call you when we are married. Of course wife and husband do not fit, but partner feels to insignificant. Any ideas?\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:15:54.342000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T03:17:12.564000Z","id":"738233383510868049","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Spouse if you want to be formal, but lover or darling or sweetheart or baby or anything else you'd like can work when we're not in a courthouse!\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:18:20.132000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738233994998579261","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Ah of course spouse. How silly of me sweetheart.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:20:22.959000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738234510172356629","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"That's alright,\" They smile, \"I'd be your paramour if it meant I could live my life in your arms.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:21:05.265000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738234687616712726","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I am afraid you won't have the opportunity. Another thing. I know you mentioned you wanted to adopt all the childeren, but Wren and Skitter seem to be dating. We cannot try to make them siblings.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:23:19.636000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738235251209404416","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"That would be... quite weird. Shall we adopt one and just *support* the other? Wren seems to be an aspiring merchant, I'd be happy to sponsor her while taking Skitter as our ward.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:25:32.359000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738235807890014238","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"Yes I wish to adopt Skitter, they have no family. The two of them have been quite, *handsy* as well. Nothing overtly inappropriate. It is just constant despite the situations.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:28:15.463000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-30T03:28:22.842000Z","id":"738236491997642762","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I think we should talk to them about being appropriate.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:28:40.288000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738236596121501758","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"736445407357304852","content":"\"I think so too. If anything came of my past, it's *manners*.\"","created_at":"2020-07-30T03:29:14.351000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"738236738991816795","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
